<lg type="poem"><head><hi rendition="#b"><hi rendition="#g">Der Mittag.</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/><lb/>
<lg n="1"><head><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#fr">Arie.</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr"><hi rendition="#in">D</hi>er Mittag, begleitet von fa&#x0364;chelnden</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#in"><hi rendition="#et">Stunden,</hi></hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#et">Ero&#x0364;fnet &#x017F;ein Fu&#x0364;llhorn, mit Blumen um-<lb/>
