<fw type="sig" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#aq">III</hi>ter Theil. R</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Re-</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb n="258" facs="#f0266"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">Mu&#x017F;ikali&#x017F;che Gedichte.</fw><lb/>
<lg n="2"><head><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#fr">Recitativ.</hi></hi></head><lb/>
<l>Empfange mich, ehrwu&#x0364;rdger Eichenwald!</l><lb/>
<l>Jetzt, da wir ganz vom Mittags&#x017F;tral ermatten,</l><lb/>
